Description: nvk_API
Version: 0.9.12
Author: nvk
About:
    # nvk_API

    The native extension behind nvk.tools scripts. nvk_SIGNAL requires it. nvk_SEARCH, nvk_NAVIGATE
    and other scripts use it when it is installed, for faster searching, Visual FX previews, accurate
    track zoom and more, and keep working without it.

    This package also installs nvk_GUI, nvk.tools' build of ReaImGui, which the scripts draw their
    windows with when it is present, and its Lua wrapper. nvk_GUI is licensed under the GNU LGPL
    version 3 or later. Matching source, dependency inputs and build instructions are included in
    nvk_GUI-source.tar.xz beside the installed extensions.

    Requires REAPER 7.55 or later, on macOS 14 or later, 64-bit Windows, or x86-64 Linux with glibc 2.35 or later
    and X11/XWayland. Restart REAPER after installing or updating so the new version loads.
Links:
    Website https://nvk.tools
Changelog:
    0.9.12
        Install staged updates when REAPER quits so the next session loads the updated extension
        Preserve existing output files when copying or delivering renders on Windows
        Keep previously tagged Vordio clips and captions out of folder item selections
    0.9.10
        Preserve floating window sizes on Windows displays using fractional scaling
        Open recently used plug-in editors faster
    0.9.9
        Reopen script windows without REAPER's running-script prompt
        Preview media items without requiring SWS
    0.9.8
        Keep SIGNAL responsive while analyzing long recordings and importing audio
        Improve SIGNAL waveform drawing, selected-item previews and recording drag previews
        Reduce idle processing in SIGNAL analysis displays
        Keep NAVIGATE responsive in large projects and improve SEARCH startup and large-library searches
        Preserve named folder items when merging and respect Rename settings saved with each project
        Improve script-window responsiveness and recovery from drawing errors
    0.9.7
        Add SIGNAL's waveform draw styles and sample-level zoom, and let it drop silent channels and detect mono when inserting a recording
        Let NAVIGATE list a project's subprojects
        Let SEARCH capture a script's window for its Visual FX screenshot
        Never count Vordio's empty video items as folder items
        Keep the visible video while other tracks are soloed
        Keep modifier keys working with the mouse wheel over unfocused script windows
        Start background commands without a process window on Windows
        Fix crashes when script windows close
    0.9.6
        Upgrade Dear ImGui and draw script windows faster
        Animate CREATE2's effect displays at the screen's refresh rate
        Add the engines behind CREATE2's WIDTH Repair, Focus, Gravity and Reverb
        Re-render CREATE2 designs only from the first effect that changed
        Render queued Morph jobs in parallel and speed up many effects
        Let SIGNAL capture a track's output, capture the master before Monitoring FX, and add Stereo Bands
        Respect REAPER's Hidden FX folder in SEARCH
        Keep Folder Items from marking the projects it opens as changed, and keep Region Render Matrix routing when folder items are resized
        Scroll focused tracks into view below pinned tracks
        Download updates and the CLAP analysis pack through the system's network and proxy settings
        Keep always-on-top script windows below REAPER's dialogs
        Fix mixed text sizes in script windows, library search, and loading modules from network paths on Windows
    0.9.5
        Build SEARCH's index in the background so REAPER stays responsive at startup
        Add loudness history for SIGNAL, including drawing loudness along the project timeline
        Fix non-English characters in settings files on Windows
    0.9.4
        First release through ReaPack
Provides:
    [darwin-arm64] darwin-arm64/reaper_nvk_api.dylib > reaper_nvk_api.dylib
    [darwin-arm64] darwin-arm64/nvk_plugin_scan > nvk_plugin_scan
    [darwin-arm64] darwin-arm64/reaper_nvkgui-aarch64.dylib > reaper_nvkgui-aarch64.dylib
    [darwin64] darwin64/reaper_nvk_api.dylib > reaper_nvk_api.dylib
    [darwin64] darwin64/nvk_plugin_scan > nvk_plugin_scan
    [darwin64] darwin64/reaper_nvkgui-x86_64.dylib > reaper_nvkgui-x86_64.dylib
    [win64] win64/reaper_nvk_api.dll > reaper_nvk_api.dll
    [win64] win64/nvk_plugin_scan.exe > nvk_plugin_scan.exe
    [win64] win64/reaper_nvkgui-x64.dll > reaper_nvkgui-x64.dll
    [linux64] linux64/reaper_nvk_api.so > reaper_nvk_api.so
    [linux64] linux64/nvk_plugin_scan > nvk_plugin_scan
    [linux64] linux64/reaper_nvkgui-x86_64.so > reaper_nvkgui-x86_64.so
